S += box('Headline', f"Moving to an elite club at 24 or under changes a player's share of league minutes by {100 * mA['att']:+.1f} points (95% CI {100 * mA['ci95'][0]:+.1f} to {100 * mA['ci95'][1]:+.1f}) and his style-neutral output by {zf(oA['att'])} index points ({oA['ci95'][0]:+.1f} to {oA['ci95'][1]:+.1f}) against a twin who stayed. Neither is distinguishable from zero, and the effect does not flip by age: {100 * CFm['21 or under']['cate']:+.1f} points at 21 or under, {100 * CFm['23-24']['cate']:+.1f} at 23-24.")
